{"id":"ne8f0104354","headline":"RBI To Soon Release Draft Guidelines For On-Tap Licensing Of Urban Cooperative Banks, Paving Way For Fresh Licences","summary":"The Reserve Bank of India will soon release draft guidelines for on-tap licensing of urban cooperative banks, paving the way for fresh licences after a long pause. It will also review rural co-op concentration risk norms.","why":"The Reserve Bank of India is the country's central bank and regulator, and its licensing rules determine which lenders can enter and grow in the banking system.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/rbi-to-soon-release-draft-guidelines-for-on-tap-licensing-of-urban-cooperative-banks-paving-way-for-fresh-licences"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/rbi-to-soon-release-draft-guidelines-for-on-tap-licensing-of-urban-cooperative-banks-paving-way-for-fresh-licences"}],"published_at":"2026-08-05T08:04:52Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"4e4a0733e700e665","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-05T08:04:52Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-05T09:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-4665138.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"GAIMARD","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/modern-architecture-a